description	"Lobot

A man of few words, preferring to commune with the technological over the biological.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lobot's Wrench (Yellow/Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- 125% more knockback
-- 100% more special damage
-- 35% shorter
-- 166% thicker
- Relby-K23 'Stinger' Blaster Pistol (WESTAR 2)
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 15% more velocity
-- 20% more damage/FP damage
- BSoD Frag Grenades (2)
-- Blinds on det
- V-59 Conc Grenades (3)

^6Inventory:
- Medpac ^3[CS4]
- Forcefield
- Assault Sentry

^8Attributes:
- 30% faster hacking
